WEBVTT

00:00:01.102 --> 00:00:05.571
Search Google Finance for your company's ticker and open its page. This example is Charles Schwab, SCHW

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:11.208
Select 5Y to show the last five years

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:16.137
Select Compare

00:00:16.137 --> 00:00:26.304
Type S&P 500 and choose the line marked .INX

00:00:26.304 --> 00:00:29.137
Move your pointer off the chart, so the table shows the whole five years

00:00:29.137 --> 00:00:36.518
The table under the chart gives each line's % Change over the five years

00:00:36.518 --> 00:00:42.278
Take a screenshot of the chart and the table, and paste it into your note
